.tsx","title":"Authentication is a product entry point","description":"Phone, WhatsApp OTP, roles, and sessions","speakerNotes":""},{"id":"0c7c8b20-42ee-4d2b-9c4a-01a0c0e3b110","position":10,"filepath":"src/pages/slides/Slide10GroupedOrders.tsx","title":"One cart can become grouped orders","description":"Multi-restaurant carts and child-order allocation","speakerNotes":""},{"id":"0c7c8b20-42ee-4d2b-9c4a-01a0c0e3b111","position":11,"filepath":"src/pages/slides/Slide11Paymob.tsx","title":"Paymob handles the external payment edge","description":"Hosted checkout, webhooks, settlement, and recovery","speakerNotes":""},{"id":"0c7c8b20-42ee-4d2b-9c4a-01a0c0e3b112","position":12,"filepath":"src/pages/slides/Slide12Wallet.tsx","title":"Wallet payments are ledger-backed","description":"Partial payments with append-only accounting","speakerNotes":""},{"id":"0c7c8b20-42ee-4d2b-9c4a-01a0c0e3b113","position":13,"filepath":"src/pages/slides/Slide13CancellationRefunds.tsx","title":"Cancellation and refunds have different paths","description":"Customer cancellation, provider refunds, and admin approval","speakerNotes":""},{"id":"0c7c8b20-42ee-4d2b-9c4a-01a0c0e3b114","position":14,"filepath":"src/pages/slides/Slide14Tracking.tsx","title":"Tracking respects lifecycle and privacy","description":"Active-trip collection and role-scoped visibility","speakerNotes":""},{"id":"0c7c8b20-42ee-4d2b-9c4a-01a0c0e3b115","position":15,"filepath":"src/pages/slides/Slide15TypedContract.tsx","title":"A typed contract connects the product","description":"React/Vite, Express, PostgreSQL, Drizzle, Zod, and OpenAPI","speakerNotes":""},{"id":"0c7c8b20-42ee-4d2b-9c4a-01a0c0e3b116","position":16,"filepath":"src/pages/slides/Slide16MoneyGuards.tsx","title":"Money movement is guarded twice","description":"Application and database safeguards","speakerNotes":""},{"id":"0c7c8b20-42ee-4d2b-9c4a-01a0c0e3b117","position":17,"filepath":"src/pages/slides/Slide17Validated.tsx","title":"Implemented and validated","descr